cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AuralPaths in your work, please cite it as below, with the version you used (the page shows it, and saved configs and exported files record it)."
type: software
title: "AuralPaths: a research and teaching tool for the precedence effect in sound reinforcement"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based binaural room simulator for direct sound plus delayed loudspeaker (PA) paths. Vary hall,
  loudspeaker and seat positions, delay and level, then compute, listen to and export binaural room impulse
  responses (SOFA, WAV). Image sources, ray tracing and first-order edge diffraction; shoebox, drawn 2.5D and
  OBJ 3D halls; calibration of absorption to measured T30; checks against measured halls (BRAS, Fratoni).
authors:
  - family-names: "You"
    given-names: "Dong-Gyun"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-0075-4695"
version: "0.6.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
license: MIT
